{
  "_id": "84bae2a8a3af6f4c",
  "name": "Technique Thief",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/blade-tip-orange.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 17th level, you gain the ability to magically steal the knowledge of how to cast a spell from another spellcaster. Immediately after a creature casts a spell that targets you or includes you in its area of effect, you can use your reaction to force the creature to make a saving throw with its spellcasting ability modifier against your spell save DC. On a failed save, you negate the spell's effect against you, and you steal the knowledge of the spell if it is at least 1st level and of a level you can cast. For the next 8 hours, you know the spell and can cast it using your spell slots.</p>",
